WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.821
A course has filled. Tell
the website in a few taps.

2
00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:05.551
Open Quick update.

3
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:07.551
Press Mark a course full or waitlisted.

4
00:00:07.551 --> 00:00:12.946
Pick the course from the list.

5
00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:16.963
Choose Waitlist, or Full
if there is no room.

6
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:20.642
Add a short note if you like.

7
00:00:20.642 --> 00:00:24.379
Press Save. The course card
changes in a few minutes.

8
00:00:24.379 --> 00:00:29.105
To set it back later,
choose Open here again.
